WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.270
<b>Episode Eight
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.890
Dragon-Slaying Sword!

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.310
Thor's Hammer!

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.750
Die,

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.250
Destroyer Moduo!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.290
Destroy his core!

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:21.850
Wait...

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.720
Wait!

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.710
I should die,

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.030
but I cannot die yet!

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.830
If you kill me,

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.890
things will only get much worse.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.120
Drop the act.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.870
You fooled us once with your stories.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:41.560
It won't happen again!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.640
I'm not lying!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.420
You don't understand.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.620
I, Moduo, am a monster!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:54.320
Ever since I was born, I was cursed.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.590
I was possessed by evil spirits.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:00.540
Have you heard of parasitic spirits?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.370
They feed on the flesh and brains 
of their hosts for sustenance.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.750
They slowly eat away at their hosts 
until they take complete control.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.680
In the end, they swallow their hosts whole.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.850
When I was born,

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.620
my mother died giving birth to me.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:17.800
A few years later,

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:21.360
my father had a mental breakdown 
and committed suicide.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:25.250
Monster! Monster!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.390
Everyone thought of me as a monster.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:34.490
A monster who often lost 
control of his own body.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.860
The village people called me a disaster.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:44.020
They held a trial and beat me up viciously.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:47.940
Then,

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.470
they left me to die in the mountains.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.060
None of them thought

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.410
that I would survive.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.540
Are you eating dirt?

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.770
Poor guy.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.170
I'll share half of my lunch with you.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.450
Sorry.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.500
I ate it all.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.230
It's okay. I wasn't hungry.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.140
I'll bring you something to eat again.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.610
Oh, right.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.790
This is our secret.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.250
Don't tell anyone.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.270
Th-Thanks.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.460
Ever since,

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.810
she'd give me half her food every day.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:55.640
That kind girl was named Ah Hua.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.680
I love flowers.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.710
You can do it!

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:01.310
She always dreamed about growing flowers

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.500
out of the rocks.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.000
It died again.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.750
That's the 832nd time.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.850
It's so hard to grow anything 
in the Stone Forest.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:15.910
It's okay.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.200
I'll have my dad bring even more 
flower seeds from the outside.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:23.110
One day, I'll turn this place 
into a sea of flowers!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.350
Can I have a seed?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.430
Sure.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.430
<b>Several Weeks Later</b>

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.160
Whoa, that's amazing!

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:43.060
It's a white equinox flower!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.360
Thanks, Moduo.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.200
It was the first time in my life

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.930
that I'd found something I wanted to protect.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.060
The days went by quickly,

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.350
one year

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:09.580
after another.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.870
But all good things come to an end.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.380
Things gradually deteriorated 
in Black Stone Village.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.460
The harvests got worse, year after year.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.810
Many villagers went hungry, all year round.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.200
He's the village's curse!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:32.100
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.100
We're all suffering because of him!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.200
Moduo didn't cause this disaster!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.590
He's not a curse!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.030
Don't hurt him!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.880
He's still alive after being chained up 
and starved for eight years!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.470
Ah Hua, we found out long ago 
that it was your doing!

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.050
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:48.790
No!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:49.560
Moduo's...

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:55.620
Stop hitting him!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.810
No!

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.680
Go die!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.820
Ah Hua.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.560
No one...

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:37.560
can hurt my flower!

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.360
Monster!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.250
The parasite, and the anger that had 
been building in me for years, took over.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.750
I destroyed everything around me,

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.240
leveling the entire village.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.300
That day,

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.600
the villagers' cries blanketed the lands.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.820
Much blood was spilled...

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.700
...and their flesh enriched the soil.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:53.600
From that day onward,

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:58.270
flowers started to grow atop the rocks.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.500
Above the countless corpses

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:07.200
grew a sea of blood-red equinox flowers.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.580
I'm the one who killed Ah Hua.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:16.390
I killed everyone.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.990
I should die.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.430
I deserve to die,

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.600
but I must stay alive.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:27.390
That's the only way to keep 
that spirit from escaping.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:29.600
To tell the truth,

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.000
the chains on my chest are not a core.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.140
They're actually...

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:48.140
I'm detecting strong spiritual energy 
fluctuations at unprecedented levels!

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:49.220
No way!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.500
Moduo!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.060
Sir!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:25.270
Moduo's in trouble.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.400
What?

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.780
Gather the other members.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.460
Right away.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.400
How interesting.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.520
There is someone who poses a threat to Moduo?

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:44.180
They will regret doing so

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.310
very soon.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.220
That reminds me.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.270
I remember the first time we met Moduo.

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:53.620
It was raining heavily.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.590
That pitiful boy was on his 
knees among the flowers,

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.480
crying like a child.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:05.810
I know you're exhausted and battered,

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.410
but...

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.470
do not be afraid.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.270
Because...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.790
You are not alone.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:30.520
These chains I'm giving you can temporarily 
seal away the parasite within you.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.020
Most of the time, you will get 
to live as a normal human,

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.600
and find peace for your body and soul.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.580
However, when you lose your sanity 
and your control over yourself,

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.310
we would like you to come and help us

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.790
when our work requires destruction.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:53.060
That is your contract with the Destroyers.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.410
Thanks.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.870
Now I remember.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:07.410
Those chains are for restraining 
Moduo's parasitic spirit.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.600
Once the chains are broken...

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.040
...the true evil spirit

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:16.450
will be released.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.700
Moduo!

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.540
His heartbeat has stopped.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.970
He's dead.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:45.280
<i>What?</i>

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.560
The thing that's standing in front of us

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:52.240
is no more than a tragic, walking corpse.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.330
Let's go!

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.560
Take this!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.560
Wolf Fangs!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.080
It dissipated?

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:42.850
How is that possible?

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.020
Miaowu!

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.060
Stan!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.680
Ah Jie, watch out!

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:43.680
Silver Lance!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.520
Beautifully done!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:57.770
What?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.620
Its defense is too strong!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.620
I need all your energy!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.080
Focus all of it in one spot!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.440
We'll take it down in one blow!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.860
I'll do my best.

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.120
Ah Jie!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.220
Kill it!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:00.930
Ah Jie!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.580
Ah Jie!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:04.470
Wake up!

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.500
Without you,

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.460
I can't keep on fighting!

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:09.620
Ah Jie!

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:11.040
Ah Jie!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.090
Ah Jie!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.410
Where am I?

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.100
That crystal...

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.200
Ah Jie!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.850
Ah Jie!

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.020
No matter what happens...

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:54.780
I will never leave Ah Jie's side!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.450
Don't worry.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.430
Ah Jie!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.680
Don't hurt him!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.310
Summoning...

00:17:58.790 --> 00:17:59.790
Rain of Swords.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.260
Judgment of Heaven.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.220
D-Dora...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.130
<i>That day,</i>

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.740
<i>I saw...</i>

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.310
<i>a true goddess.</i>

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.900
Ah Jie!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:47.140
Ah Jie!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.900
Ah Jie!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.810
Are you okay?!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.720
I've... been worse.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.190
Where are Miaowu and Stan?

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.310
Like that could kill me.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.180
I'm... okay too.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:14.680
That was our first battle.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.060
Is it... finally over?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.860
Moduo's dead.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.180
There goes our lead.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.340
We don't need any more leads.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.130
The Destroyers will find us.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.810
From here on out,

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.930
we will...

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:35.850
be hunted by them.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.340
Farewell,

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:45.290
Moduo.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.930
Memory Read.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.350
I see.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:37.960
Equinox flowers...

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:39.970
They bloom for a millennium,

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:41.140
and wither for a millennium.

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.700
The flowers bloom without leaves,

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.580
and grow leaves when they don't bloom.

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.740
Their paths never intersect, never to meet.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.800
The flowers on this path 
to the land of the dead

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:55.390
curse all men such that 
they will never be together.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.500
Rest in peace, Moduo.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:00.820
At the very least,

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.100
you will no longer suffer.
